      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "This study examined the association of single nucleotide polymorphisms in 4 candidate genes in a cohort of subjects with aspirin resistance. Aspirin resistance was significantly associated with genetic variation in the platelet surface adenosine 5-diphosphate receptor gene P2Y1."},
